---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { buildTitle, buildDescription, buildCanonical, buildBreadcrumbs } from '../lib/seo.ts';

const ownerEmail = import.meta.env.OWNER_EMAIL || 'contact@pricegpu.com';
const title = buildTitle(['Privacy Policy', 'PriceGPU']);
const description = buildDescription('PriceGPU privacy policy. How we collect, use, and protect your data.');
const canonical = buildCanonical('/privacy');
const schemas = [buildBreadcrumbs([{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Privacy Policy', url: '/privacy' }])];
---

<Layout {title} {description} {canonical} {schemas}>
  <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Privacy Policy</span></nav>
  <h1 style="font-size: 1.75rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="prose">
    <p><strong>Last updated: November 2026</strong></p>

    <h2>Data Controller</h2>
    <p>PriceGPU operates from Spain and is the data controller for personal data collected through this site. For privacy inquiries, contact us at <code>{ownerEmail}</code>.</p>

    <h2>What data we collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>First-party analytics:</strong> for each page view and outbound click we record the page, external referrer host, country and device class. No cookies, and no IP address or user identifier is stored.</li>
      <li><strong>Google AdSense cookies:</strong> non-essential cookies for ad personalization (only if you accept cookies via our consent banner). Google sets its own advertising cookies; see Google's policy below.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate click redirects:</strong> when you click "Rent" or "Try [Provider]", the click passes through a redirect and is recorded as described above.</li>
      <li><strong>Web server logs:</strong> IP address, user-agent, request path, HTTP status (standard hosting logs; retained for 30 days).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Legal basis</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Consent (GDPR Art. 6.1a):</strong> for ad cookies and personalization — you grant this via the cookie consent banner.</li>
      <li><strong>Legitimate interest (GDPR Art. 6.1f):</strong> for security, fraud prevention, and aggregate analytics (web hosting).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Who we share data with</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google (AdSense):</strong> processes ad cookies for personalized ads. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="external">Google's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate networks:</strong> we redirect to RunPod, Vast.ai, Lambda, and others via referral links; they receive click data per their privacy policies.</li>
      <li><strong>Cloudflare:</strong> hosts the site and provides analytics. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="external">Cloudflare's Privacy Policy</a>.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Your rights (GDPR)</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Access:</strong> request all data we hold about you.</li>
      <li><strong>Rectification:</strong> correct inaccurate data.</li>
      <li><strong>Erasure ("right to be forgotten"):</strong> request deletion of your data.</li>
      <li><strong>Restrict processing:</strong> limit how we use your data.</li>
      <li><strong>Withdraw consent:</strong> opt out of ad cookies at any time by clicking "Cookie Settings" in the footer.</li>
      <li><strong>Complain:</strong> file a complaint with the Spanish data authority (AEPD: <a href="https://www.aepd.es" rel="external">aepd.es</a>).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise these rights, email <code>{ownerEmail}</code> with your request and proof of identity.</p>

    <h2>Cookies and consent</h2>
    <p>
      We use Google's consent message to ask for your choice on your first visit. You can:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Accept All:</strong> enable ad personalization and analytics cookies.</li>
      <li><strong>Reject All:</strong> disable non-essential cookies (equally prominent to "Accept All" per AEPD guidance).</li>
      <li><strong>Cookie Settings:</strong> open the banner again anytime via the footer link to change your choices.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Essential cookies (for site functionality and security) are never blocked.</p>

    <h2>International transfers</h2>
    <p>
      Google may process data in the US. Google LLC participates in the EU-US Data Privacy Framework and also relies on Standard Contractual Clauses for such transfers.
    </p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Web server logs: 30 days.</li>
      <li>First-party analytics: event records contain no user-level identifier.</li>
      <li>Google AdSense cookies: as per Google's retention policy (typically ~2 years for analytics).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not intended for users under 13 (or the digital age of majority in your country). We do not knowingly collect data from children. If you believe we have, contact us immediately.</p>

    <h2>Privacy policy changes</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy. Changes are effective upon posting. Significant changes will be announced via a notice on the site.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Email: <code>{ownerEmail}</code></p>
  </div>
</Layout>
